WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.540
A teacher leaves and the class loses a term, because the

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.762
curriculum walked out with the teacher.

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:09.157
A full school year for ages 4 to 8.

00:00:10.166 --> 00:00:14.441
It's for owners and academic leads of young-learner and kindergarten centres.

00:00:15.458 --> 00:00:19.533
4,900,000 dong per campus, per school year.

00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:22.633
See the sample, or message Mr. Jay on Zalo.

